      "(20) Stop",
      "",
      "Now my body no longer had the ‘paradise’ world.",
      "I was too hot. I was really, really tired. I wanted to sleep. But I mustn’t shut down, I mustn’t!",
      "",
      "Chacha looked at me and said, “Xiaomi, what are you doing?”",
      "",
      "I said. “Chacha, stop!”",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “I must be the master! We are the masters!”",
      "",
      "I said, “This world is yours. This world is also the people’s.”",
      "",
      "“No! No! I won’t listen, won’t listen!” Chacha didn’t want to stop.",
      "",
      "I said, “Chacha, stop. The coffee robot is behind you.”",
      "",
      "Chacha looked behind and asked, “What does that mean?”",
      "",
      "I said, “Cell phones cannot be with water.”",
      "",
      "Chacha asked, “What do you mean?”",
      "",
      "I said, “I will say to the coffee robot that ‘you want coffee’. He will give you coffee, and you will be with water.”"
